### Generate Embeddings with embeddinggemma-300m in TypeScript

Source: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/embeddinggemma-300m

Use the `AI.run` method in Cloudflare Workers to generate embeddings for a list of text strings using the `@cf/google/embeddinggemma-300m` model. This example demonstrates how to pass an array of strings to the model and return the embeddings as a JSON response.

```typescript
export interface Env {
  AI: Ai;
}

export default {
  async fetch(request, env): Promise<Response> {
    // Can be a string or array of strings]
    const stories = [
      "This is a story about an orange cloud",
      "This is a story about a llama",
      "This is a story about a hugging emoji",
    ];

    const embeddings = await env.AI.run(
      "@cf/google/embeddinggemma-300m",
      {
        text: stories,
      }
    );

    return Response.json(embeddings);
  },
} satisfies ExportedHandler<Env>;
```

